#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:146
msgid ""
"Time-based keywords can include a ``strftime``\\ [#]_ format string to "
"customize the output and a number (representing seconds) preceded by '+' or "
"'-' which will offset the actual time. For example, ``#gps_datetime_now %I:"
"%M:%S %p +3600#`` shows only the time in 12-hour format, offset by 1 hour."
msgstr ""
"Les paraules clau basades en el temps poden incloure una cadena de format "
"``strftime``\\ [#]_ per a personalitzar la sortida i un número (representant "
"els segons) precedits per «+» o «-», el qual desplaçarà el temps real. Per "
"exemple, ``#gps_datetime_now %I:%M:%S %p +3600#`` només mostra l'hora en "
"format de 12 hores, desplaçada en 1 hora."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:148
msgid ""
"Speed and distance keywords may include an extra format keyword to convert "
"the value to metric/imperial units. Default is meters and km/h respectively."
msgstr ""
"Les paraules clau de velocitat i distància poden incloure una paraula clau "
"de format addicional per a convertir el valor en unitats mètriques/"
"imperials. De manera predeterminada són metres i km/h respectivament."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:150
msgid "Supported formats:"
msgstr "Formats admesos:"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:152
msgid ""
"Distance: **m**\\|\\ **meter**, **km**\\|\\ **kilometer**, **mi**\\|\\ "
"**mile**, **ft**\\|\\ **feet**, **nm**\\|\\ **nautical**"
msgstr ""
"Distància: **m**\\|\\ **meter**, **km**\\|\\ **kilometer**, **mi**\\|\\ "
"**mile**, **ft**\\|\\ **feet**, **nm**\\|\\ **nautical**"

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:153
msgid ""
"Speed: **ms**\\|\\ **m/s**\\|\\ **meters**, **km**\\|\\ **km/h**\\|\\ "
"**kilo**, **mih**\\|\\ **mi/h**\\|\\ **mileh**, **fts**\\|\\ **ft/s**\\|\\ "
"**feet**, **kn**\\|\\ **nm/h**\\|\\ **knots**."
msgstr ""
"Velocitat: **ms**\\|\\ **m/s**\\|\\ **meters**, **km**\\|\\ **km/h**\\|\\ "
"**kilo**, **mih**\\|\\ **mi/h**\\|\\ **mileh**, **fts**\\|\\ **ft/s**\\|\\ "
"**feet**, **kn**\\|\\ **nm/h**\\|\\ **knots**."

#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/generate/gps_text.rst:157
